# Sethos Tighnari Fischl Sucrose. ~18s Rot. Sethos Tighanri Aggravate. Sethos uses a Shadowpiercing shot to apply Electro at the start of the rotation. Fischl alternates skill and burst. Tighnari uses burst after CA if available. Sucrose buffs both Sethos and Tighnari. 

# Team - Options Listed by DPS
sethos char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
